{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269R7gPcmM8J1794647976.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名82歲婆婆在牛頭角，被輕型貨車撞倒昏迷送院，司機涉嫌危險駕駛被捕。</p><p></p><p>警方中午接報，涉事輕型貨車沿著通明街，右轉入牛頭角道，撞倒正在過馬路的婆婆。</p><p></p><p>40歲司機在車上協助調查。婆婆後腦受傷昏迷，送往伊利沙伯醫院救治。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:03:14.987301+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:16:39.890570+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:56:30.508158+00:00","content_hash":"27d831b08f691010a007c016fcce97d7d0ea3843fa8a2b8bcf135eda7e3d4cfe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:03:14.987301+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}